# The stdio -> Streamable HTTP bridge (prompt 12 §14.3): mcp-proxy (MIT,
# sparfenyuk/mcp-proxy). Its own venv: mcp-proxy imports mcp's 1.x server
# internals (0.12.0 breaks on mcp 2.x, 0.13.0 says mcp<2), while the newer
# mcp-server-time releases need mcp>=2.3; the two never share a resolution.
mcp-proxy
mcp<2
